WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Title card. A gold paw print on a dark green background with the words: Why big cats need guardians.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
A male lion with a dark mane stands in tall green grass and roars. The camera slowly moves closer.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A tiger and her cub walk together through deep snow. The cub presses its face against its mother's.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
A spotted leopard walks through grass straight toward the camera.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
End card. A gold paw print with the words: You can help. Learn about big cats. Share what you learn. Volunteer with Riverside Big Cat Guardians.
